{"path":"numeric/random/seed_seq/param","title":"std::seed_seq::param","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::seed_seq::</span>param","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/numeric/random/seed_seq/param","section":"numeric","kind":"page","summary":"Copies the stored seeds to the range beginning with dest. Equivalent to std::copy(v .begin(), v .end(), dest);.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> OutputIt <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br><span class=\"kw4\">void</span> param<span class=\"br0\">(</span> OutputIt dest <span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Copies the stored seeds to the range beginning with <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">dest</span></code>. Equivalent to <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/algorithm/copy\"><span class=\"kw1594\">std::<span class=\"me2\">copy</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span></span><code><i><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/random/seed_seq#v\">v</a></i></code> ﻿<span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">.<span class=\"me1\">begin</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>,</span><code>&nbsp;</code><code><i><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/random/seed_seq#v\">v</a></i></code> ﻿<span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">.<span class=\"me1\">end</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>, dest<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></code>.\n</p><p>If values of type <code>result_type</code> are not <a href=\"/w/cpp/iterator#Types_and_writability\">writable</a> to <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">dest</span></code>, the program is ill-formed.\n</p><p>If <code>OutputIt</code> does not satisfy the requirements of <a href=\"/w/cpp/named_req/OutputIterator\"><em class=\"t-named-req\">LegacyOutputIterator</em></a>, the behavior is undefined.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> dest\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> the beginning iterator of the output range\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Exceptions\">Exceptions</h3>\n<p>Only throws the exceptions thrown by the operations on <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">dest</span></code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iterator&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;random&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/random/seed_seq\"><span class=\"kw1512\">std::<span class=\"me2\">seed_seq</span></span></a> s1 <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"nu0\">1</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">0</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">1</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    s1.<span class=\"me1\">param</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/iterator/ostream_iterator\"><span class=\"kw675\">std::<span class=\"me2\">ostream_iterator</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a>, <span class=\"st0\">\" \"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>-1 0 1</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"Defect_reports\">Defect reports</h3>\n<p>The following behavior-changing defect reports were applied retroactively to previously published C++ standards.\n</p>\n<table class=\"dsctable\">\n<tr>\n<th>DR\n</th>\n<th>Applied to\n</th>\n<th>Behavior as published\n</th>\n<th>Correct behavior\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cplusplus.github.io/LWG/issue2180\" data-external=\"1\">LWG 2180</a>\n</td>\n<td>C++11\n</td>\n<td><code>seed_seq::param</code> is non-throwing\n</td>\n<td>it may throw exceptions\n</td></tr></table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Exceptions","id":"Exceptions"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"Defect reports","id":"Defect_reports"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"numeric","title":"Numerics library"},{"path":"numeric/random","title":"Pseudo-random number generation"},{"path":"numeric/random/seed_seq","title":"std::seed_seq"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::seed_seq::param","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++11. Copies the stored seeds to the range beginning with dest. Equivalent to std::copy(v .begin(), v .end(), dest);."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"dest"},{"label":"Exceptions","note":"Only throws the exceptions thrown by the operations on dest."},{"label":"Example"}]},"standards":["C++11"],"wordCount":133,"codeBlockCount":2}
